@title Hoist in 3D follows a closed-loop winch of Drive run: the hook rises with the winch and the line under the controls says so
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane L2c. Simulate > Drive run starts the winch of the closed-loop fixture, Simulate > Hoist in 3D opens the
# picture, which lists the winch next to the hoists and follows its hook (height, speed, drive state).
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 40
key Home
wait 30
shot picture-before-lifting
expect "Hoist in 3D"
expect "hook +0.00 m from its start"
# Radio step 2 (S2) lifts the hook; the line follows it.
mouse_down 371 351
wait 3000
expect "rising"
shot hook-rising-in-the-picture
mouse_up 371 351
wait 800
expect "Picture, not measurement"
check_layout
shot stopped
